# Authored MDX docs: Prettier's Markdown formatter reflows fenced code blocks
# embedded in Fumadocs components (e.g. inside <Tab>), which breaks the MDX
# build. Content is owned by the docs, not the formatter — leave it untouched.
apps/*/content/**/*.mdx

# Release-validated workflow artifacts are byte-for-byte snapshots whose SHA-256
# values are checked by tests; formatting them would invalidate catalog integrity.
apps/web/public/workflows/*.yml
apps/web/src/data/workflow-catalog.json

# Family-wide doc synced byte-for-byte from the family root (`make family-doc-sync`);
# every repo must hold an identical copy, so the formatter must not touch it.
docs/spine-family.md
